{"path":"index.html","content":"<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
  <title>{{BUSINESS_NAME}} — {{TAGLINE}}</title>
  <meta name="description" content="A practical, safety-forward aromatherapy practice offering events, series, and guided rituals that may support calm and clarity.">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/css/styles.css">
</head>
<body>
  <header class="site-header">
    <div class="brand">
      <a href="/" class="logo">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</a>
      <p class="tagline">{{TAGLINE}}</p>
    </div>
    <nav class="main-nav" aria-label="Primary">
      <ul>
        <li><a href="/">Home</a></li>
        <li><a href="/services.html">Offerings</a></li>
        <li><a href="/blends.html">Signature Blends</a></li>
        <li><a href="/shop.html">Essentials</a></li>
        <li><a href="/pricing.html">Plans</a></li>
        <li><a href="/about.html">Our Story</a></li>
        <li><a href="/book.html">Reserve</a></li>
        <li><a href="/contact.html">Connect</a></li>
      </ul>
    </nav>
    <div class="header-cta">
      <a class="btn primary" href="{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="hero panel" id="hero">
      <div class="hero-inner">
        <h1>Thoughtfully-led aromatherapy sessions and event series that may support calm and clarity</h1>
        <p class="lead">Small-group and studio events designed to introduce safe practices so you can use aroma with intention. No medical claims — only practical ritual and safety guidance.</p>
        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a class="btn" href="/book.html">Reserve a spot</a>
          <button id="tryButton" class="btn secondary">Try it now — guided</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="pillars panel reveal-on-scroll" id="pillars">
      <div class="panel-inner">
        <h2>Core approaches</h2>
        <div class="cards">
          <article class="card">
            <h3>Ritual Series</h3>
            <p>Curated multi-week events that introduce ritualized practices pairing gentle scent use with mindful movement and journaling. May support ground and routine.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="card">
            <h3>Blends & Workshops</h3>
            <p>Hands-on sessions where you explore safe blending, dilution, and patch-testing. Learn to create supportive aromas for home practice.</p>
          </article>
          <article class="card">
            <h3>Private Consults</h3>
            <p>One-on-one sessions to review safe use guidelines tailored to your life stage and household. No promises — only guidance that may support well-being.</p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="myth-truth panel reveal-on-scroll" id="myth_vs_truth">
      <div class="panel-inner">
        <h2>Common questions — myth vs. thoughtful practice</h2>
        <div class="mt-grid">
          <div class="mt-item">
            <h4>Myth</h4>
            <p>All essential oils are safe just because they are natural.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-item">
            <h4>Thoughtful practice</h4>
            <p>Plant extracts are powerful. We discuss dilution, patch tests, and contraindications so you can use them responsibly.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-item">
            <h4>Myth</h4>
            <p>If it smells good, it will help everyone the same way.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="mt-item">
            <h4>Thoughtful practice</h4>
            <p>Response to aroma is individual. Events focus on exploration and matching safe approaches to your needs.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="case-notes panel reveal-on-scroll" id="case_notes">
      <div class="panel-inner">
        <h2>Notes from sessions</h2>
        <ul class="notes">
          <li>Week-long series exploring evening routines — attendees reported new awareness around ritual and choice (anecdotal impressions only).</li>
          <li>Workshop on blend safety included hands-on dilution practice and pet-safe options for shared spaces.</li>
          <li>Small-group session introducing breath + aroma showed participants practical ways to pair scent with intention setting.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="faq panel reveal-on-scroll" id="faq">
      <div class="panel-inner">
        <h2>Frequently asked — safety-first</h2>
        <dl>
          <dt>Are essential oils safe during pregnancy?</dt>
          <dd>Some oils are best avoided in pregnancy. We recommend consulting your healthcare provider and following session guidance; individual considerations are discussed in private consults.</dd>

          <dt>How should I dilute oils?</dt>
          <dd>We teach conservative dilution guidelines during workshops (e.g., 1% for facial use); always patch test and follow safety steps provided in sessions.</dd>

          <dt>What about pets?</dt>
          <dd>Certain oils can affect animals differently. We cover pet-safe choices and diffusion practices so home use considers all household members.</dd>

          <dt>Do you make medical claims?</dt>
          <dd>No. We do not claim to treat or diagnose conditions. Language used is that practices may support comfort, routine, or attention.</dd>
        </dl>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="cta panel" id="final_cta">
      <div class="panel-inner">
        <h2>Join the next series or try a guided mini-practice</h2>
        <p>Events run seasonally; spots are limited to keep groups small. If you want a short introduction now, try the guided practice.</p>
        <div class="actions">
          <a class="btn primary" href="/book.html">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</a>
          <button id="tryButton2" class="btn outline">Quick guided exercise</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer class="site-footer">
    <div class="footer-inner">
      <div class="contact">
        <p>Phone: {{PHONE}}</p>
        <p>Email: <a href="mailto:{{EMAIL}}">{{EMAIL}}</a></p>
        <p>Serving: {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</p>
      </div>
      <div class="credits">© <span id="year"></span> {{BUSINESS_NAME}} — Events & series</div>
    </div>
  </footer>

  <!-- Guided exercise modal -->
  <div id="exerciseModal" class="modal" aria-hidden="true" role="dialog" aria-modal="true">
    <div class="modal-panel" role="document">
      <button class="modal-close" id="closeModal" aria-label="Close">×</button>
      <div class="modal-content">
        <h3 id="exerciseTitle">Try a guided mini-practice</h3>
        <p class="modal-desc">Choose a short practice: gentle breathing, journaling prompt, or intention setting. This is an introductory exercise and may support presence.</p>

        <div id="stepSelector" class="steps">
          <button class="step" data-step="breath">Breathing (2 min)</button>
          <button class="step" data-step="journal">Journaling (5 min)</button>
          <button class="step" data-step="intention">Intention (3 prompts)</button>
        </div>

        <div id="exerciseArea" class="exercise-area" aria-live="polite"></div>

        <div class="modal-actions">
          <button id="startExercise" class="btn primary">Start</button>
          <button id="cancelExercise" class="btn outline">Cancel</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <script src="assets/js/main.js"></script>
</body>
</html>"} 
